# walking — only a way gone by is a known way
#
# Free walking goes by ways the party has taken, and by no other. Two neighbouring areas each stood
# in are not thereby joined: here the yard and the field are both visited, but the field was reached
# from the shore across the ford, so the plain way between field and yard has never been walked.
#
# It used to count as known the moment both its ends were — and a member sent back to the yard
# walked it, a way nobody had ever taken. Now the walk goes round by what was taken (the ford, then
# the way from the shore), the untaken way keeps its symbol on its line, and taking it is an act
# that teaches what a new way back teaches.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Yard" --period dawn

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180
strategy succeed

# Yard -> shore, by the plain way: an act, since it has never been gone by.
goal move
click observe "Test Shore"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Shore"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click act 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect Moved to: Test Shore
click continue
advance 12 180

# Shore -> field, across the ford.
goal swim_across
click observe "Test Ford"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Ford"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click act swim_across
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect Moved to: Test Field
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-state where Test Field

# Field and yard are both ground stood on, and neighbours. The way between them was never taken:
# it is still a symbol on its line, looked at from the field.
expect-state symbols click observe "the way to Test Yard" in "Test Field" (way)

# Sent back to the yard, the member goes round by the ways gone by: the ford, then the shore.
click area "Test Yard"
wait
expect-state where Test Yard
expect-state map walk from Test Field to Test Yard by way of Test Shore > Test Yard
expect-state noetic points=3/3

# The untaken way is an act, and comes out on known ground: it teaches how the place joins up.
goal move
click observe "Test Field"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Field"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click act 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect Moved to: Test Field
expect Modus mentis learned: Retracing
click continue
advance 12 180

# Gone by, it is a known way: no symbol, and the direct walk.
expect-no-state symbols click observe "the way to Test Yard"
click area "Test Yard"
wait
expect-state map walk from Test Field to Test Yard by way of Test Yard
quit
